3	 * Multi-party signing support added: signer steps, sequential workflow, audit trail.
4	 *
5	 * Manages school-level agreement templates and per-student agreement records.
6	 *
7	 * Agreement Templates (school admin):
8	 *   GET    /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates
9	 *   POST   /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates
10	 *   PATCH  /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates/:id
11	 *   PATCH  /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates/:id/field-definitions
12	 *   PATCH  /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates/:id/status
13	 *   DELETE /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates/:id
14	 *
15	 * Student Agreements:
16	 *   GET    /locations/:locationId/students/:studentId/agreements
17	 *   POST   /locations/:locationId/students/:studentId/agreements
18	 *   PATCH  /locations/:locationId/students/:studentId/agreements/:id/void
19	 *   PATCH  /locations/:locationId/students/:studentId/agreements/:id/send
20	 *
21	 * Count (for tab badge):
22	 *   GET    /locations/:locationId/students/:studentId/agreements/pending-count
23	 *
24	 * Workflow Config (school admin):
25	 *   PATCH  /schools/:schoolId/agreement-templates/:id/workflow — save multi-party signing workflow
26	 *
27	 * Public Signing (no auth):
28	 *   GET    /sign/:token            — get agreement details by secure token (student or admin step)
29	 *   GET    /sign/:token/pdf-url    — get presigned S3 URL for the PDF (no auth, token-secured)
30	 *   POST   /sign/:token/submit     — submit signature and field values (advances workflow if multi-party)
